Darts are not that volatile when you get your luck maxed
and the darts blessed and enchanted beyond +2. You can
hit with them 200 times on an average before they will
disappear. I would think that a set of 50 darts would
suffice for a moderate game, and 100 for a not too slow
game.

+7 poisoned Darts at expert and maxed strength have
an average damage of 33. It is better than many artifacts
and is even better because it can be used at range.

