The strategy to use till you get your best weapon ie darts to be
usable, is to first use pets and occasionally daggers. Once you
get a unicorn horn you can start using it as your main melee
weapon, and keep daggers as missiles. You would probably
get expert in unicorn horn and get it enchanted, before you are
even able to use the darts. But keep on collecting them. You
should have a nice collection of at least 100 by the time you
start using them. After the quest however you would want to
wield your quest artifact in the main dungeon. Inside

You don't want to spend darts unless they are at least +2
enchanted because they are very volatile otherwise.

